# The formulae a CI build installs into the arm64 Homebrew, one per line,
# with everything they depend on: the ones profile.sh lists (DEPS_FORMULAE,
# which the bundle and Wine's configure use, and MESA_FORMULAE, which
# build-mesa.sh's host tools link), and the build tools the scripts run that
# a runner image need not have. bin/ci/brew.sh installs them at the newest
# versions Homebrew has and fails when profile.sh names a formula that is
# missing here.

# DEPS_FORMULAE
freetype
gnutls
sdl2-compat
sdl3
bison
pkgconf

# MESA_FORMULAE
llvm
spirv-llvm-translator
spirv-tools

# Build tools
cmake
ninja
meson
glslang
# What WINE_BUILD_CCACHE names in release.yml
ccache
